         *leave the view there until the sf flights complete their 
         attack!*
         
         Every time you jump back to your F-16, you're probably 
         leaving the kill box and so "turning off" the enemy SAMs--so 
         the ground attack flight have nothing to line up on. Then, when 
         you jump *back* to their view, you reenter the kill box and 
         *suddenly* "switch on" the SAMs there, which find your SF 


                                                                          


